2. Row name link + empty CTA: the web row name links to /automations/{id} and the empty CTA
   navigates to /automations/new (the builder) — both separate, out-of-scope parity units.
   Exposed as injected shell hooks (onOpenAutomation / onOpenBuilder, default no-op),
   mirroring the sibling AutomationsListPage's onCreate seam — real wired affordances.
3. Navigation: /automations/list is a SECONDARY route under the automations hub (which owns
   the top-level .automations AppRoute), not a primary sidebar/tab destination. Surfaced as a
   typed NavigationDestination (AutomationListLink) + a factory, mirroring the DONE sibling
