4. Reuse + decoupling: the shared AutomationListItem row type (defined in AutomationsListModels,
   same module) is REUSED (DRY — the two automations surfaces agree on the Automation shape);
   the surface defines its OWN AutomationListLoadPhase so it does not couple to the sibling
