5. a11y string split: the web row checkbox carries BOTH a visually-hidden <label> (bulk.selectRow)
   and a specific aria-label (automationList.selectAutomation, with the name). Native renders the
   specific per-automation string as the checkbox .accessibilityLabel and the generic "Select row"
